                    {
                        "sense_id": "01177d74-4ba7-3f7d-8c53-6b4369db1aff",
                        "entry_id": "8a679fc8-2eca-3f40-b87d-70f79c0067b6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "морск., истор. трёхмачтовый парусный (парусно-винтовой) быстроходный военный корабль для разведывательной, дозорной и посыльной служб"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c3026301-fef4-392d-9c75-125e768848b2",
                        "entry_id": "8a679fc8-2eca-3f40-b87d-70f79c0067b6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "морск. парусное судно с острыми обводами и развитой парусностью для перевозки на большие расстояния грузов (чая, пряностей и др.)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "96abc0a7-e76f-46e4-a43e-fccf34eba70b",
                        "source_entry_id": "8a679fc8-2eca-3f40-b87d-70f79c0067b6",
                        "target_lang_word": "clipper",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "clipper",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e53af296-6bf6-3870-ba29-bd3943087e62",
                                        "entry_id": "53cafd72-1162-30aa-8c34-ea44c17e19f2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Anything or anyone that clips."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10f7db2d-cd43-4397-a8fe-f705a07c8687",
                                                "sense_id": "e53af296-6bf6-3870-ba29-bd3943087e62",
                                                "text": "Yes, perhaps I’d better begin there, at the moment when I […] asked a question carelessly enough of one of the locals, who was clipping a hedge in a desultory fashion nearby. […] When I passed my hedge clipper again, he said, […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7fd71f2a-05f6-3263-9af5-d569e3f660c8",
                                        "entry_id": "53cafd72-1162-30aa-8c34-ea44c17e19f2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A tool used for clipping something, such as hair, coins, or fingernails."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "in-plural"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "541b29a4-637b-385b-883c-dcdc26c5145e",
                                        "entry_id": "53cafd72-1162-30aa-8c34-ea44c17e19f2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that moves swiftly; especially:",
                                            "Any of several forms of very fast sailing ships having a long, low hull and a sharply raked stem."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "251bbc3f-01c6-30d9-9d97-71dba828d52e",
                                        "entry_id": "53cafd72-1162-30aa-8c34-ea44c17e19f2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that moves swiftly; especially:",
                                            "An Alberta clipper."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "be4e67c8-1824-3519-8969-30df041e8815",
                                        "entry_id": "53cafd72-1162-30aa-8c34-ea44c17e19f2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An Asian butterfly of species Parthenos sylvia, family Nymphalidae."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "541ec21b-29cf-379e-95de-88386022b730",
                                        "entry_id": "53cafd72-1162-30aa-8c34-ea44c17e19f2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A circuit which prevents the amplitude of a wave from exceeding a set value."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9ccf0311-d04b-36a2-8c37-12d318000085",
                                        "entry_id": "53cafd72-1162-30aa-8c34-ea44c17e19f2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who mutilates coins by fraudulently paring the edges."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e93be065-fb5f-478e-b2e8-f84bb846a063",
                                                "sense_id": "9ccf0311-d04b-36a2-8c37-12d318000085",
                                                "text": "Indeed, the French may lay twenty French crowns to one, they will beat us; for they bear them on their shoulders: but it is no English treason to cut French crowns, and to-morrow the king himself will be a clipper."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40dfe506-f5d3-43c9-8466-91a114a487a0",
                                                "sense_id": "9ccf0311-d04b-36a2-8c37-12d318000085",
                                                "text": "Many a wretch who has been drawn upon a hurdle, has done less mischief than those barterers of forged lies, coiners of scandal, and clippers of reputation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "90396327-3cf9-48e5-adcb-c2fb1ae5c774",
                                                "sense_id": "9ccf0311-d04b-36a2-8c37-12d318000085",
                                                "text": "Surtouts billowing in an unseasonably fierce wind, the ursine Chelmsford magistrate and his equally bulky constable herded their bound prisoners – three murderers, three thieves, a coin clipper, two convicted witches – across the Common […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c4c99d9a-cb25-3d54-875c-79de648d4510",
                                        "entry_id": "53cafd72-1162-30aa-8c34-ea44c17e19f2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A confidence trickster; a conman."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f41736b3-900b-4cbc-8b09-5d18a6034655",
                                                "sense_id": "c4c99d9a-cb25-3d54-875c-79de648d4510",
                                                "text": "\"You have head enough for both of us, Beck,\" said he. \"You're sure to get us out of the scrape. I never saw your equal, and I've met with some clippers in my time too.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "89fab4c9-8f01-3a48-a7fd-f2e5db20b1fb",
                                        "entry_id": "53cafd72-1162-30aa-8c34-ea44c17e19f2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Anything showy or first-rate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3a572311-7950-4776-ae98-40a9fc641b95",
                                                "sense_id": "89fab4c9-8f01-3a48-a7fd-f2e5db20b1fb",
                                                "text": "Well, he was courtin' Sister Sall. She was a real handsum looking gal; […] a real clipper, and as full of fun and frolic as a kitten."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "clipper",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7e8fa095-b7f8-3e11-bf40-d50e249569c8",
                                        "entry_id": "f061e1b7-d162-35ff-94ca-5688d93ecda1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cut or style (the hair) using clippers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0f6b2a5-2b77-4ce1-8a58-e7af6fdf2a2b",
                                                "sense_id": "7e8fa095-b7f8-3e11-bf40-d50e249569c8",
                                                "text": "Rocks was having his hair clippered by another prisoner when Collins calmly walked past and sliced open the side of his face without breaking his stride."
                                            }
